---
// One verb, four shapes.
---
<figure class="illus">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 176" role="img" aria-labelledby="stems-art-t">
    <title id="stems-art-t">The verb 書く goes through four stem functions and comes out as four shapes: 書き for the ます-stem, 書か for the ない-stem, 書こ for the う-stem and 書け for the ば-stem.</title>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="5" y="68" width="70" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="40" y="88">書く</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="40" y="128">one verb</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M75 88C150 88 190 23 270 23H340" /><path class="il-ah" d="M350 23l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <path class="il-a" d="M75 88C150 88 190 67 270 67H340" /><path class="il-ah" d="M350 67l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <path class="il-a" d="M75 88C150 88 190 111 270 111H340" /><path class="il-ah" d="M350 111l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <path class="il-a" d="M75 88C150 88 190 155 270 155H340" /><path class="il-ah" d="M350 155l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="309" y="14">ます-stem</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="309" y="58">ない-stem</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="309" y="102">う-stem</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="309" y="146">ば-stem</text>
    <rect class="il-stem" x="350" y="6" width="120" height="34" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="410" y="23">書き</text>
    <rect class="il-stem" x="350" y="50" width="120" height="34" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="410" y="67">書か</text>
    <rect class="il-stem" x="350" y="94" width="120" height="34" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="410" y="111">書こ</text>
    <rect class="il-stem" x="350" y="138" width="120" height="34" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="410" y="155">書け</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>A stem changes the verb's shape. Which shape depends on what comes next.</figcaption>
</figure>
